Package: unix-guardian
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Unix Guardian <unixguardian@atomicmail.io>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: @DEPENDS@, dbus, polkitd | policykit-1, systemd
Recommends: power-profiles-daemon, nftables, iproute2
Suggests: mangohud
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/AGlegendery/Unix-Guardian
Description: Linux gaming utility: game mode, monitoring, GPU tuning
 Unix Guardian detects games and tunes the system while they run (CPU,
 memory, background services, network), and puts everything back
 afterwards. It monitors CPU, GPU, memory and network, tunes NVIDIA and
 AMD graphics cards, records playtime and FPS, and sets up MangoHud.
 .
 A root service (unix-guardiand), a per-user agent, the ug command line
 tool, a terminal interface (ug tui) and a window (ug-app).
 .
 This is a beta.
